  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 212.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-03-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 212.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to create a rational and uniform system for identifying habitually reckless or negligent drivers and habitual or frequent violators of traffic laws governing the movement of vehicles.\n\nSource. #4207, eff 1-16-87; ss by #4451, eff 6-24-88; ss by #4844, eff 6-20-90; amd by #5688, eff 8-20-93; amd by #6249, INTERIM, eff 6-16-96, EXPIRES: 10-14-96; ss and moved by #6337, eff 9-25-96 (from Saf-C 211.01); ss by #8174, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRES: 3-24-05; ss by #8230-B, eff 12-17-04; ss by #10395-B, eff 8-15-13",
